    18	
    19	- **No source chapter was opened.** No file under `books/` was read, searched, listed or grepped by me at any point in this session. Events came from the packet, BOOK_MAP (the plan sections; §5 windows; §7–§9; §10 protected wording; §11 release limits; §12 conflicts), STATE_LEDGER, and the edition's own closed chapters.
