editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/STATE_LEDGER.md-315-She received it at Iron 3. It is her newest. She had shown it to one person before (unnamed). She wrote it from memory on a card, showed it, and took it home. The ability label **[Drawn Channel]** needs owner approval.
