   151	It was not only the hold. A reading taken with that thing could be checked by nobody. He might write that the fan was sound at a certain place, and be right, and a ford-keeper six days off would have nothing but his word for it; and Cael had lived since his Kindling under figures that could not be checked by the person they concerned. What Karis did with a knotted cord, any carter could do after her, at the same place, and get the same number or call her a liar. That was the map the man was buying. The other would only have been a boy on a hillside saying that he knew.
